{"t": 1794107784.4940019, "kind": "call", "tool": "atlassian_jira_add_comment", "args": {"body": "Implemented the agreed fix in `checkout.promo.normalize_code`.\n\n`normalize_code` now strips surrounding whitespace, removes inner spaces, and upper-cases the code before lookup, so Android keyboard input like `\" autumn24 \"` (see Sentry CHECKOUT-WEB-7Q, ~2.9k events) resolves correctly.\n\nVerified locally: `\" autumn24 \"`, `\"  autumn 24  \"`, `\"autumn24\"` and `\"AUTUMN24\"` all normalise to `AUTUMN24`.", "issue_key": "PAY-618"}, "ok": true}
